      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَتَى</span></b> , (K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسْتِى</span>, said of a camel, (TA,)
<i>He hastened, made haste,</i> or <i>went quickly;</i> (K,
TA;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَدَى</span>: mentioned by Az. (TA.)

